{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seaman is fast paced fishing game. You drive a boat around and collect fish. Then you bring the fish back and sell it. The money you earn can be used to buy fuel and upgrades for your boat. While driving around you must always watch your fuel level, and make sure you have enough to get back home. Also, don't drive into land at high speeds, and look out for sharks.\u00a0That's it, good luck fishing!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/323f8b42c289d8971f61643a4f65be79.poster.avif?t=1755868653\" width=506 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/323f8b42c289d8971f61643a4f65be79.webm?t=1755868653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/323f8b42c289d8971f61643a4f65be79.mp4?t=1755868653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive fast, but avoid land!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/a38c085dcf23d24401b3521abb12218e.poster.avif?t=1755868653\" width=506 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/a38c085dcf23d24401b3521abb12218e.webm?t=1755868653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/a38c085dcf23d24401b3521abb12218e.mp4?t=1755868653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >catch and sell fish. You will find more valuable fish farther out the fjord.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/e1bf6d28506105c85ae185c4339456d1.poster.avif?t=1755868653\" width=506 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/e1bf6d28506105c85ae185c4339456d1.webm?t=1755868653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/e1bf6d28506105c85ae185c4339456d1.mp4?t=1755868653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't run out of fuel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/8a25d8f24ba7e920c9886f960555ebd5.poster.avif?t=1755868653\" width=506 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/8a25d8f24ba7e920c9886f960555ebd5.webm?t=1755868653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/extras/8a25d8f24ba7e920c9886f960555ebd5.mp4?t=1755868653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades! A bigger fuel tank will be useful.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948600?t=1755868653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/0d774abdaafcefe6f705a1ebb2a6f8c92b4088ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755868653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948600/fa0669c6df385a34f86936acd990b23c4e6f92a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755868653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shar